{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>When you spread out.</b> The resh comes with a chirik in place of a patach katon." "<b>[I will hide My eyes from you].</b> The meaning: that I will conceal mercy from you." "Similarly <b>I will not hear</b>; the meaning: that I will not save you." "Because <b>your hands are full of blood</b>; the meaning: shedding of blood."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:51.797777457Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}